WEBVTT

00:12:57.996 --> 00:13:02.537
So how do we begin to dismantle rigidity
and embrace emotional agility?

00:13:04.121 --> 00:13:08.246
As that young schoolgirl when I
leaned into those blank pages.

00:13:09.204 --> 00:13:14.746
I started to do away with feelings
of what I should be experiencing

00:13:15.579 --> 00:13:22.121
and instead started to open my heart
to what I did feel pain and grief.

00:13:23.204 --> 00:13:25.537
And loss and regret.

00:13:28.412 --> 00:13:34.329
Research now shows that the radical
acceptance of all of our emotions,